# Airport Flight Board & Scheduler

## Project Description

This project is a simple Java-based Airport Flight Board and Scheduler. It displays flight information and allows the user to check and update the status of a flight.

## Features

* Display flight information
* Check flight status
* Update flight status
* Display scheduled, delayed, or departed status
* Simple menu-driven program

## Technologies Used

* Java
* Visual Studio Code
* GitHub

## Java Concepts Used

* Variables
* String
* Scanner
* if-else statements
* switch statement
* do-while loop

## Sample Flight

* Flight: AI101
* Airline: Air India
* Destination: Delhi
* Departure Time: 09:30 AM
* Gate: A1
* Status: Scheduled

## How to Run

1. Open `AirportFlightScheduler.java` in VS Code.
2. Compile and run the Java program.
3. Select an option from the menu.
4. Follow the instructions displayed on the screen.

